{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101131","id":2260460003,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Gu-Hj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101131","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101131.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101131.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101131","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101131/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101131/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101131/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/861752b7f906cd31940faa29d9677bcc01f5f682","number":101131,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `is_anything_pressed` by using `physical_keys_pressed` to detect if a key is pressed","user":{"login":"pcvonz","id":6378569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzg1Njk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6378569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz","html_url":"https://github.com/pcvonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\n~When a modifier key is released (shift, ctl, alt, etc.), keys that use a modifier will now be removed from the pressed keyset map. This fixes an issue with the `is_anything_pressed` method on `Input` ([steps to reproduce here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100879#issuecomment-2566728979)).~\r\n\r\n~Things to consider...~\r\n~- Instead of removing the keys from the set, the key could be modified (e.g. `_` becomes `-`, `I` becomes `i`). This doesn't seem to matter since a new keypress event for `-` or `i` will be generated after shift is released.~\r\n\r\nI found an easier solution: This will now change the `is_anything_pressed` method to use the `physical_keys_pressed` set instead of `keys_pressed` because `keys_pressed` will have stale keys if you press a modifier and then release the modified key, which causes `is_anything_pressed` to always return true. Physical keys pressed seems to make more sense anyways for detecting if a key is pressed or not. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reas